  "name": {
    "@value": "Dataset from A Phase 3B, Randomized, Double-Blind Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Abatacept SC in Combination With Methotrexate Compared to Methotrexate Monotherapy in Achieving Clinical Remission in Adults With Early Rheumatoid Arthritis Who Are Methotrexate Naive"
  },
  "description": {
    "@value": "The purpose of this study is to determine if abatacept is effective in the treatment of early rheumatoid arthritis."
  },
